pple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">华为小艺 Work 开启内测，支持跨端远程指挥并接管多台电脑</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI 宣布 GPT-5.5 模型将于 10 月 14 日正式下线并移除</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic 推出 Salesforce in Claude 插件，实现 CRM 数据深度集成与自动化管理</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌发布Gemini 3.8 Live及Extended Thinking，强化实时语音推理与任务执行</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/9f37ad9d7c886865ebd33c5267301615.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌正式发布Gemini 3.8 Live与Gemini 3.8 Live Extended Thinking，两款模型现已登陆Gemini API及Google AI Studio。核心升级在于支持AI在持续语音对话中后台执行工具与API调用，实现语音与思考同步处理，无需中断交流。模型支持97种语言自动检测及中途切换，并具备近实时视觉定位能力。性能方面，Extended Thinking版本在Big Bench Audio测试中达到97.7%，Gemini 3.8 Live在Speech Agent Arena排名第二。谷歌已与Agora、LiveKit、Vercel等平台达成合作，并为所有生成音频嵌入SynthID水印。此次更新标志着语音AI从单纯的“听与说”向具备持续推理与多任务处理能力的智能体形态演进，</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">苹果在iPhone 18 Pro/Max引入Apple Reference Image功能实现像素级硬件签名</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f065d41fe8aaab72de1f068f1d0e36f4.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">苹果公司于9月15日发布Apple Reference Image功能，正式在iPhone 18 Pro及iPhone 18 Pro Max机型上引入像素级真实图像标注。该功能通过在拍摄瞬间于SEP（Secure Enclave Processor）内对关键元数据进行硬件签名，生成不可伪造的“数字负片”，旨在对抗AI伪造图片。系统通过加密时间戳服务绑定拍摄时间的上下界，确保图像来源真实且防篡改。与传统后期元数据签名不同，该技术实现了“拍时签名”，配合Private Cloud Compute验证链，为新闻机构及证据留存场景提供全链路可信验证。此举将图像真实性验证前置至传感器层面，显著提升了图像来源的可追溯性与防伪能力，为行业建立可信图像标准提供了硬件级解决方案。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">华为小艺 Work 开启内测，支持跨端远程指挥并接管多台电脑</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/87e8b2c1c084a1697362cc7a9f6e321a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">华为于9月16日正式开启小艺 Work 内测，该AI工作助理定位办公、开发及创意创作场景，支持鸿蒙手机、平板及Windows电脑。用户可通过鸿蒙电脑端小艺App预约，或下载Windows客户端（版本0.6.9）。核心功能包括任务自主拆解、工具调用及跨端协同，用户可远程下发任务并实时查看进度，支持同时连接多台电脑执行任务。该服务涵盖研究分析、编程及内容创作，任务执行环境可选云电脑或本地电脑。备案信息显示，小艺 Work 集成了DeepSeek、华为云盘古NLP、MiniMax、智谱及Moonshot等模型算法。会员体系采用AI点数计费，按任务复杂度消耗。华为强调，小艺 Work 的记忆功能用于跨会话同步个人偏好与工作信息，明确承诺不用于模型训练。付费会员数据保留7天，免费会员数据失效后将立即删除。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI 宣布 GPT-5.5 模型将于 10 月 14 日正式下线并移除</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/582a5a22738f6362a99e79de2688fac9.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI 于 9 月 16 日正式宣布，GPT-5.5 模型将于 10 月 14 日起从 ChatGPT、ChatGPT Work 及 Codex 平台中全面下线，该调整覆盖所有订阅方案。GPT-5.5 于今年 4 月 24 日发布，核心优势在于相比 GPT-5.4 能显著降低任务执行中的 Token 消耗。针对此次模型停用，OpenAI 明确建议 Codex 用户尽快完成迁移，目前官方提供的替代方案为 GPT-5.6 Sol 或 GPT-6 Astra 模型。此次调整意味着依赖 GPT-5.5 的开发者与企业用户需在 10 月 14 日前完成模型适配与切换，以避免业务中断。OpenAI 此举旨在通过精简模型矩阵，引导用户向更高性能的 GPT-5.6 Sol 及 GPT-6 Astra 迁移，从而优化整体计</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic 推出 Salesforce in Claude 插件，实现 CRM 数据深度集成与自动化管理</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/19eac7cf8de7d3a828a9704bb12670da.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic 于 9 月 15 日正式发布 Salesforce in Claude 插件测试版，将 Salesforce 平台的客户数据、商机及销售管道全面接入 Claude。该插件集成 37 项销售业务功能，支持在用户授权下安全读取 Salesforce 和 Slack 业务信息，并可在人工批准后主动更新销售记录。目前，该插件已向所有付费 Claude 用户开放测试，并已在 GitLab、西门子及 Legora 等企业落地，覆盖约 7000 名一线销售人员。此举旨在通过 AI 赋能客户研究、会议准备及管道分析，显著提升销售人员的 CRM 管理效率与业务决策能力。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
